{
  "$comment": [
    "Reports moved to sup.co/research/{brands,niches}/<slug>/<year>/<month> on 2026-09-08.",
    "This project is now the STORE, not the public address. Two hosts, two behaviours:",
    "  - reports.sup.co  -> 301s everything to the sup.co canonical (host-scoped redirects).",
    "  - sup-reports.vercel.app -> still SERVES the files. sup-site proxies to it via a",
    "    Next.js rewrite, so this alias must never redirect or the proxy breaks.",
    "That is why every redirect below carries a `has` host condition. Removing it would",
    "make the alias redirect to sup.co, which rewrites back here — an infinite loop.",
    "No X-Robots-Tag noindex on the alias either: proxied response headers pass through",
    "the rewrite, so a noindex here would noindex the live sup.co URL. Duplicate content",
    "on the alias is handled by the canonical tag in each report's <head> instead."
  ],
  "cleanUrls": true,
  "trailingSlash": false,
  "redirects": [
    {
      "source": "/",
      "has": [{ "type": "host", "value": "reports.sup.co" }],
      "destination": "https://sup.co/research",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/brands/:slug/:year(\\d{4})/:month/:file*",
      "has": [{ "type": "host", "value": "reports.sup.co" }],
      "destination": "https://sup.co/research/brands/:slug/:year/:month/:file*",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/brands/:slug/:year(\\d{4})/:month",
      "has": [{ "type": "host", "value": "reports.sup.co" }],
      "destination": "https://sup.co/research/brands/:slug/:year/:month",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/niches/:slug/:year(\\d{4})/:month/:file*",
      "has": [{ "type": "host", "value": "reports.sup.co" }],
      "destination": "https://sup.co/research/niches/:slug/:year/:month/:file*",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/niches/:slug/:year(\\d{4})/:month",
      "has": [{ "type": "host", "value": "reports.sup.co" }],
      "destination": "https://sup.co/research/niches/:slug/:year/:month",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/:slug/:year(\\d{4})/:month/:file*",
      "has": [{ "type": "host", "value": "reports.sup.co" }],
      "destination": "https://sup.co/research/brands/:slug/:year/:month/:file*",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/:slug/:year(\\d{4})/:month",
      "has": [{ "type": "host", "value": "reports.sup.co" }],
      "destination": "https://sup.co/research/brands/:slug/:year/:month",
      "permanent": true
    }
  ],
  "rewrites": [
    { "source": "/brands/:slug/:year(\\d{4})/:month/:file*", "destination": "/reports/brands/:slug/:year/:month/:file*" },
    { "source": "/brands/:slug/:year(\\d{4})/:month", "destination": "/reports/brands/:slug/:year/:month" },
    { "source": "/niches/:slug/:year(\\d{4})/:month/:file*", "destination": "/reports/niches/:slug/:year/:month/:file*" },
    { "source": "/niches/:slug/:year(\\d{4})/:month", "destination": "/reports/niches/:slug/:year/:month" }
  ],
  "headers": [
    {
      "source": "/reports/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=300, s-maxage=3600, stale-while-revalidate=86400" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "X-Content-Type-Options", "value": "nosniff" },
        { "key": "Referrer-Policy", "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin" },
        { "key": "Permissions-Policy", "value": "camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
